hyper TFB plaintext baseline (moved from the M3 design-phase perf prototype,
m3-perf-proto/hyper-tfb; docs/design.md section 9).

TFB frameworks/Rust/hyper/src/main.rs (57d92fb) with the DB routes removed,
hyper pinned to rev 7f67699 (1.12.0), tokio 1.53.2 (Cargo.lock), one
current-thread runtime per thread, SO_REUSEPORT, TCP_NODELAY, backlog 4096,
pipeline_flush(true) (PFLUSH=0 turns it off), no timer, LTO, codegen-units 1.

Build:  cargo build --release            (or CARGO_TARGET_DIR=... to build elsewhere)
Run:    THREADS=4 taskset -c 0-3 target/release/hyper-tfb 18080
